OL,3,GNEWSACCTV car catches 5,000 illegally
OL,4,Aparked drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car equipped with a CCTV camera has
OL,7,Fcaught more than 5,000 drivers parking
OL,8,Fillegally after patrolling Leicester
OL,9,Ffor four months.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council introduced the
OL,12,Fenforcement vehicle, equipped with a
OL,13,Fnumber plate recognition camera, on 1
OL,14,FApril to help tackle illegal and
OL,15,Fdangerous parking.
OL,17,FIt has been monitoring red routes,
OL,18,Fzigzag markings outside schools and bus
OL,19,Fstop clearways, and drivers breaking
OL,20,Fthe rules are issued with a #70 fixed
OL,21,Fpenalty notice.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
