OL,3,GNEWSACCTV car catches 5,000 illegally
OL,4,Aparked drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council it had issued 5,229
OL,7,Ffixed penalty notices to drivers caught
OL,8,Fby the camera car between 1 April and
OL,9,Fthe end of July, and was in the process
OL,10,Fof procuring a second vehicle.
